{
  "title": "IngredientRowView `Note` button persists a literal space as the \
note",
  "description": "`Ramekin/IngredientRowView.swift:82` toggles the note field \
visible by doing `ingredient.note = \" \"` — a single space. The visibility \
predicate on line 33 (`!ingredient.note.isEmpty || ingredient.item.isEmpty`) \
treats that space as a real note, so the field appears but the persisted note \
is `\" \"`. That space round-trips to the server on save. Fix by driving \
visibility from a separate `@State var showingNote: Bool` (or an \
`isNoteVisible` on `EditableIngredient`) instead of coercing the text content.",
  "status": "open",
  "priority": 2,
  "type": "task",
  "labels": [
    "ios",
  ],
  "created_at": "2026-04-17T12:00:00-07:00",
  "updated_at": "2026-04-17T12:00:00-07:00",
}
